099100       PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP
099200     END-IF.
099300
099400     MOVE STR-ONHAND TO SAVE-ONHAND-BEFORE (SUB).
099500     MOVE STR-RESERVED TO SAVE-RSRVD-BEFORE (SUB).
099600     MOVE STR-REORDER TO SAVE-REORDER (SUB).
099700     MOVE STR-EXPEDITE TO SAVE-EXPEDITE (SUB).
