100500
100600     IF SCOM-PGM-KEY = "SW4"
100700         MOVE "I1"  TO RET-CODE
100800     ELSE
100900         MOVE "R1"  TO RET-CODE
101000     END-IF.
101100
           PERFORM VARYING SUB5 FROM 1 BY 1
                   UNTIL SUB5 GREATER THAN 6

               MOVE WLT-BIN (SUB, SUB5) TO  FIL-BIN (SUB, SUB5)
               MOVE WLT-QTY (SUB, SUB5) TO  FIL-QTY (SUB, SUB5)
           END-PERFORM.

      *------5/7/97 INIT BIN-AREA WITH FRANCHISE FOR BINS
           PERFORM VARYING FRAN-SUB FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL FRAN-SUB > 6
               IF FRAN-TABLE = SPACES
                   MOVE SPACES TO FIL-FRAN(SUB FRAN-SUB)
               ELSE
                   SET FRAN-IDX TO 1
                   SEARCH FRAN-ENTRY
                     AT END  MOVE SPACES TO FIL-FRAN (SUB FRAN-SUB)
                     WHEN FRAN-ID(FRAN-IDX) = STR-BIN-OWNER (FRAN-SUB)
                      MOVE FRAN-NAME(FRAN-IDX) TO FIL-FRAN(SUB FRAN-SUB)
                   END-SEARCH
               END-IF
           END-PERFORM.
101200* HERE, "TQYTEDIT" UPDATES THE ACTUAL BIN QUANTITIES IN
101300* THE CORP CODE BUFFER, AS WELL AS THE TOTAL ONHAND.
101400     MOVE SAVE-MMIS-QTY (SUB)  TO  QTY-ISSUED
101500     CALL "TQTYEDIT" USING RET-CODE, BASE, STATUS-AREA,
101600       CODE-ARG, WLT-WO (SUB), STR-ONHAND, STR-RESERVED,
101700       STR-LOC-AREA, FIL-BIN-AREA (SUB), EDIT-TOTAL-QTY,
101800       ISSUED-QTY, RET-SUB, MESSAGE-BUFFER,
101900       MULTIPLE-STR-DATA, LANGUAGE-PARMS, WARNING-FLAG,
             WARNING-TYPE, WARNING-VALUE, STR-AVG-COST,
             WLT-CHARGE-DEPT-1-4(SUB), WLT-EXP-CLASS(SUB, 6),
             WLT-EMPL(SUB), STR-UM, STR-MAX, STR-REORDER
             STR-CODE-OWNER FRAN-TABLE.
102000     IF RET-CODE NOT = "00"
102100       MOVE "TQTYEDIT ERROR" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
102200       PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP
102300     END-IF.
102400     IF MESSAGE-BUFFER-1 NOT EQUAL SPACES
102500       MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER           TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
102600       MOVE "EDIT ERROR ON QTY-EDIT" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
102700       PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP
102800     END-IF.
           PERFORM VARYING SUB5 FROM 1 BY 1
                   UNTIL SUB5 GREATER THAN 6

               MOVE FIL-BIN (SUB, SUB5) TO  WLT-BIN (SUB, SUB5)
               MOVE FIL-QTY (SUB, SUB5) TO  WLT-QTY (SUB, SUB5)
           END-PERFORM.

102900     MOVE STR-ONHAND TO SAVE-ONHAND-AFTER (SUB).
103000     MOVE STR-RESERVED TO SAVE-RSRVD-AFTER (SUB).
103100     MOVE EDIT-TOTAL-QTY TO SAVE-TOTAL-QTY (SUB).
103200
103300**************************************************************
103400**   DETERMINE DATE & TIME FOR TRANSACTION.  NOTE THAT DATE **
103500**   & TIME AT THIS INSTANT WILL BE USED FOR MSTORERM       **
103600**   UPDATE, TRANSACTION, AND PRINTOUT.                     **
103700**************************************************************
103800
103900     MOVE 1 TO DATE-MODE.
104000     CALL "TDATECK2" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS.
104100     MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT TO SAVE-DATE (SUB).
104200     MOVE DATE-UNFORMATTED-TIME-OUT TO  SAVE-TIME (SUB).
      *------INCLUDE CENTURY IN ACTIVITY DATE
104300     MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT TO STR-ACT-DATE.
           IF STR-ACT-DATE-YY > "70"
               MOVE "19" TO STR-ACT-DATE-CC
           ELSE
               MOVE "20" TO STR-ACT-DATE-CC.
104400     MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT TO SAVE-FORM-DATE (SUB).
104500     MOVE DATE-FORMATTED-TIME-OUT TO SAVE-FORM-TIME (SUB).
104600
104700     IF SCOM-PGM-KEY = "SW4"
      *-------INCLUDE CENTURY FOR LAST ISSUE DATE
104800       MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT TO STR-LAST-IDATE
             IF STR-ISS-DATE-YY > "70"
                 MOVE "19" TO STR-LAST-IDATE-CC
             ELSE
                 MOVE "20" TO STR-LAST-IDATE-CC
             END-IF
104900       MOVE WLT-EMPL (SUB) TO  STR-LAST-EMPL
105000       IF AKRON-PLANT
105100         IF WLT-IT-J-Z-CHECK (SUB) = "I" OR "J" OR "Z"
105200           MOVE WLT-WO (SUB) TO STR-LAST-CHARGE
105300         ELSE
105400         IF WLT-STATIONERY-CHECK (SUB) = "R" OR "D" OR "T"
105500                                             OR "S"
105600           MOVE WLT-REQ-DEPT (SUB) TO STR-LAST-CHARGE
105700         ELSE
105800         IF WLT-CHARGE-TYPE (SUB) = "4" OR "5"
105900           MOVE WLT-REQ-DEPT (SUB) TO STR-LAST-CHARGE
106000         ELSE
106100           MOVE WLT-CHARGE-DEPT (SUB) TO STR-LAST-CHARGE
106200       ELSE
106300         MOVE WLT-CHARGE-DEPT (SUB) TO STR-LAST-CHARGE
106400       END-IF
106500
106600     END-IF.
106700
106800     PERFORM 9999-UPDATE-MSTORERM-CD-O.
106900
