110800* PURPOSE   : TO UPDATE REQFILE FOR CODES ON WORKSHEET       *
110900*    "TREQFILU" DETERMINES WHETHER TO UPDATE REQFILE FOR     *
111000*    EACH CODE, AND OPENS AND CLOSES REQFILE.                *
111100*    ("01" IN RET-CODE TELLS IT TO OPEN, THEN CLOSE FILE).   *
111200**************************************************************
111300 86-TREQFILU-UPDATE.
